<section style="background:#1a1a18; padding:80px 20px;">
  <div style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;">

    <div style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(201,164,90,0.15); border:1.5px solid #c9a45a; border-radius:50px; padding:5px 16px; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:#c9a45a; margin-bottom:20px;">CUSTOM BUILDS</div>

    <h2 style="font-size:2.2rem; color:#f4ede0; margin:0 0 18px; line-height:1.25;">We Build Any Sauna You Can Dream Up</h2>

    <p style="color:rgba(244,237,224,0.75); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 16px; max-width:680px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Have a unique space, a specific size in mind, or a design idea you've never seen before? We do full custom sauna builds — any shape, any size, any configuration. Our team has built everything from backyard retreats to commercial wellness facilities.</p>

    <p style="color:rgba(244,237,224,0.75); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 40px; max-width:680px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">We're craftsmen first. Bring us your vision and we'll build it.</p>

    <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:56px;">
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(201,164,90,0.3); border-radius:12px; padding:24px 28px; min-width:180px;">
        <div style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#c9a45a; font-family:var(--font-heading-family); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Any Size</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(244,237,224,0.6);">From 1-person to commercial</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(201,164,90,0.3); border-radius:12px; padding:24px 28px; min-width:180px;">
        <div style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#c9a45a; font-family:var(--font-heading-family); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Any Style</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(244,237,224,0.6);">Barrel, pod, cabin, or original</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(201,164,90,0.3); border-radius:12px; padding:24px 28px; min-width:180px;">
        <div style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#c9a45a; font-family:var(--font-heading-family); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Your Vision</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(244,237,224,0.6);">We'll build what doesn't exist yet</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" style="background:#c9a45a; border-radius:50px; padding:15px 40px; font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a18; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:0.04em; display:inline-block;">Talk to Us About a Custom Build &rarr;</a>

  </div>
</section>

